cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use joule:code in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "joule:code: Measuring and Improving the Energy Efficiency of Software"
abstract: >-
  joule:code finds the functions where a program spends its energy, lets a local LLM
  propose optimised versions, and accepts a change only if it passes the original test
  suite and uses significantly less energy in repeated, interleaved measurements.
authors:
  - name: "Institute for Digitalization Aachen | FH Aachen University of Applied Sciences | Project GreenCode"
version: 0.2.0.dev0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - energy efficiency
  - green software
  - software energy measurement
  - LLM-based code optimization
  - RAPL
